OL,3,GNEWSAFour in court over murder of baby
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and two women have appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt charged with murdering a baby
OL,8,Fgirl who had been repeatedly stabbed at
OL,9,Fa house in Sheffield.
OL,11,FThe newborn - referred to as Baby S in
OL,12,Fcourt - was found at a property in
OL,13,FHolywell Heights, in the Wincobank
OL,14,Farea, on Sunday, having suffered 33
OL,15,Fwounds from 15 separate stabbings.
OL,17,FAndrea Skopova, 20, formerly of Robey
OL,18,FStreet, Sheffield, and Peter Horvath,
OL,19,F19, Nina Horvathova, 37, and Peter
OL,20,FHorvath, 38, all of Holywell Heights,
OL,21,Fappeared at Sheffield Magistrates'
OL,22,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
