OL,3,GNEWSAFour in court over murder of baby
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe four Slovakian nationals have been
OL,7,Fcharged with murder, causing or
OL,8,Fallowing the death of a child and
OL,9,Fperverting the course of justice by
OL,10,Ftaking steps to conceal the killing of
OL,11,Fan infant.
